  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A/B Financing Agreement with Banco Internacional</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed transaction consists on an A/B senior loan of up to US$150 million (the &#x201c;Loan&#x201d;) funded as follows: (i) an A loan of up of U$$30 million to be funded by IDB Invest; and (ii) a B loan of up to US$120 million to be funded by institutional investors The Loan will be amortizable in up to five years. The Project involves funding Banco Internacional to increase its operation (balance) by increasing available lending to Small- and Mid-Sized Enterprises (&#x201c;SMEs&#x201d;) clients, as well as adding new SMEs to its portfolio. Additionally, advisory services are being designed to help Banco Internacional develop a sustainability strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
